# oracle: a second run after w125sdpd_meso_move_wiggle (run 300, then run 20, with press and its components): at the second run's setup the ghosts of the fix meso/move walls keep the velocity estimate vest of before the setup (native fix meso/move setup_pre_force sets vest = v on owned atoms only, and only the border exchange and fix sph communicate vest), which changes the sdpd viscous forces of that setup
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.6e-14, atoms 1.7e-16. Before the fix the setup row of the second run had press 0.0859831 where native prints 0.0859662.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
dimension       2
units           micro
atom_style      sph
variable        a equal 0.1
variable        T equal 300.
variable        rho_0 equal 1.
variable        c_0 equal 100.
variable        mu equal 1.
variable        h equal $a*4.5
variable        mass equal $a*$a*$a*${rho_0}
variable        dt equal 1e-3
variable        skin equal 0.2*$h
region          box block -0.5 0.5 -0.5 0.5 -0.5 0.5 units box
create_box      4 box
lattice         sq $a
create_atoms    1 box
region          upper_wall block INF INF +0.2 INF INF INF units box
set             region upper_wall type 3
region          lower_wall block INF INF INF -0.2 INF INF units box
set             region lower_wall type 4
group           fluid type 1
group           upper_wall type 3
group           lower_wall type 4
mass            * ${mass}
set             group all sph/rho ${rho_0}
pair_style      sdpd/taitwater/isothermal $T ${mu} 76787
pair_coeff      * * ${rho_0} ${c_0} ${h}
fix             1 fluid sph
fix             3 upper_wall meso/move wiggle 0.05 0 0 0.2 units box
fix             4 lower_wall meso/move wiggle 0.05 NULL 0 0.2 units box
fix             2 all enforce2d
neighbor        ${skin} bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep        ${dt}
thermo_style    custom step time pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pxy
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
run             300
thermo          5
run             20
